1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:52,650
500 years ago

25
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,530
That bastard Lin Yi

26
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:28,570
sent us here to die.

27
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:32,090
Heng Yuezi
Heng Yue Sect Founder
Late stage Nascent Soul

28
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,610
Stop complaining

29
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,650
and focus on finding a way out.

30
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,770
A spatial rift !

31
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,770
That was close !

32
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,770
Go !

33
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,290
Thank you.

34
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:03,450
I, Piao Nanzi, will repay this debt.

35
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:07,570
Brother, you don't need to worry about such small matters.

36
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,690
These spatial rifts are unpredictable.

37
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,290
Their suction force

38
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:16,250
can overpower even a Giant Demon Clan's Nascent Soul.

39
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,490
I heard that those spatial rifts

40
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:22,250
can forcibly extract the spiritual energy from your body.

41
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:27,490
Who knows what lies beyond them in the void ?

42
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,850
Save me !

43
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:27,490
Please, someone help me !

44
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:34,410
500 years later

45
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:44,450
Wandering soul

46
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:41,570
700 years later

47
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:14,490
My Divine Sense

48
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:16,250
needs to get stronger.

49
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:39,050
Still not enough...

50
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:43,090
You’ve crossed the line.

51
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,210
Who are you ?

52
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:55,370
Soul Devourer

53
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:55,450
You... You’re a new Soul Devourer ?

54
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,290
Soul Devourer ?

55
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,490
After so many years

56
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:01,770
I finally have a new companion !

57
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:03,610
We are Soul Devourers

58
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:05,090
but what does it mean ?

59
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:07,090
Those twin-horned creatures are wandering souls,

60
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,090
they’re our prey.

61
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,330
How do I leave this place ?

62
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:10,250
Leave ?

63
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,120
Why do you want to leave ?

64
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:12,410
There’s no way to leave.

65
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:15,410
Can’t we tear a spatial rift to try to leave ?

66
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:18,170
Smashing it from the inside won’t work.

67
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:20,290
The spatial rifts only open from outside.

68
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,930
The cultivators outside fight for treasures

69
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:23,050
and kill each other

70
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,970
in brutal battles...

71
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,410
Get to the point.

72
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,810
We must wait

73
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:30,490
about 40 000 years.

74
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,970
No... 42 000...?

75
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:39,210
You said the cultivators outside cause spatial rifts

76
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,450
when they fight each other for treasures.

77
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,530
Will it work with Divine Sense ?

78
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,730
Go northwest,

79
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,850
a strange empty Divine Sense appeared there.

80
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:58,770
Xu Hao
Lingwu Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

81
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,690
Little brother,

82
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,970
you need to eat.

83
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:25,010
You’ll die if you keep using your energy.

84
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,410
Even if it's been 300 years here

85
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:29,090
only 3 years have gone by outside the spatial rift.

86
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:32,010
I know you want to leave

87
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,610
but your method will not work.

88
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:36,890
Even if your Divine Sense is able to cross the rift,

89
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:39,290
as long as your soul and body aren't in the same place

90
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:41,130
you won't be able to recover your body.

91
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:52,890
This is a treasure

92
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,570
that was fated to be mine !

93
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:54,570
Kun Bu
Posuo Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

94
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:02,410
There really is some Divine Sense here.

95
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:12,930
Junior Brother, what you're doing is inappropriate.

96
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:17,680
Ge Yang
Lingwu Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

97
00:08:16,760 --> 00:08:17,730
Fellow cultivator,

98
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,250
what do you mean by this ?

99
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:22,210
And what do YOU mean by not letting go ?

100
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:24,410
Junior Brother,

101
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:27,610
he found that Divine Sense first.

102
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:28,770
Don't fight for it.

103
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:33,370
At least your Senior Brother is reasonable.

104
00:08:33,160 --> 00:08:34,860
If you don’t let go now,

105
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:36,930
don’t blame me for being ruthless !

106
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,340
Unreasonable arrogance

107
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,770
is the root of your defeat.

108
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,290
I’ll teach you

109
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:07,050
what your Senior Brother failed to !

110
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:24,330
How long will you keep watching ?

111
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,970
I only just got a chance to act.

112
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:43,410
You must always be careful.

113
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,210
Consider your bag of holding

114
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:47,250
the payment for this lesson.

115
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:54,970
This thing is really weird.

116
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,490
What is it ?

117
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:58,650
There too much empty Divine Sense here.

118
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:00,890
The more treasures, the better.

119
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:03,330
But it would make sense

120
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:06,450
if a high rank country had sent someone to investigate this matter.

121
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:09,850
Why haven't they made their move already ?

122
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:13,330
Let's keep searching.

123
00:10:21,570 --> 00:10:31,790
Note: The appearance of these characters is the same as the ones attacking Situ Nan in episode 1. These are just reused assets and not the same characters.

124
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:28,890
The Foreign Battlefield has been unstable lately.

125
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:33,290
How odd,

126
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:36,170
it was fine when I last went.

127
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:38,610
It's only been 50 years,

128
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:40,290
how could it suddenly be unstable ?

129
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:41,690
The thing is,

130
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:44,850
only Foundation Establishment cultivators can enter.

131
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:47,170
So it's more likely that a Soul Transformation like you

132
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:48,730
did something.

133
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,690
What did you say !?

134
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,490
Enough, enough.

135
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:54,690
All the cultivators cleaning the battlefield

136
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,970
are obsessed with

137
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:58,810
the regular appearance of an empty Divine Sense.

138
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:02,970
There’s an unknown variable at play here.

139
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:05,810
I saw no Divine Sense back then.

140
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:07,010
No one accused you.

141
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:11,290
The Foreign Battlefield is unstable by nature.

142
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:12,890
No one inside can leave

143
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:14,410
and no one outside can enter.

144
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:16,450
Let’s hear your suggestions.

145
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:19,850
We ask our rank 6 country for help.

146
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:21,130
You're crazy !

147
00:11:20,880 --> 00:11:22,610
They're too expensive.

148
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:25,570
If we don't have a solution,

149
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:28,010
then we let the Foundation Establishment cultivators

150
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:30,330
fend for themselves.

151
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:36,410
By the way, I revoked Zhao's qualifications.

152
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,610
No objections ?

153
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,610
I have an idea.

154
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,210
Send them a message:

155
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:51,090
"The cleanup is cancelled.

156
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,770
Focus on finding the Divine Sense.

157
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:54,210
In 3 days,

158
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:55,810
we will activate the teleportation formation

159
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:57,170
and evacuate everyone."

160
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,690
At worst,

161
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:01,890
we can pretend this cleanup never happened.

162
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,050
Alright, let's do that.

163
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:18,890
Finally...

164
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:23,810
3 days !

165
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:25,170
I’ve chased you for 3 days.

166
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:27,350
Once I get you,

167
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:29,170
I’ll return to the rally point.

168
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:31,250
Of all the disciples from the War God Shrine,

169
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,010
less than 10 survived.

170
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:36,090
The Sect Leader will surely favor me now

171
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:38,050
and make me a core disciple !

172
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,450
When that happens,

173
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:41,690
even Junior Sister will look at me differently !

174
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:50,010
Xu Hao ?

175
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:52,330
Ge Yang ?

176
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:55,650
These two are famous for murdering

177
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:57,210
and stealing treasures.

178
00:12:57,560 --> 00:12:59,690
It looks like I’ll either die

179
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:01,610
or be skinned alive.

180
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:04,530
How dare you address us by name ?

181
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:06,330
Senior Brother Ge.

182
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,930
Senior Brother Xu.

183
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:10,970
So...

184
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,850
Is this yours ?

185
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:13,810
Not at all.

186
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:15,610
This empty Divine Sense

187
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:17,460
belongs to whoever claims it first.

188
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,450
Trash...

189
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,610
What else do you have ?

190
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,090
Senior Brothers,

191
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:42,010
these are all the treasures I found here.

192
00:13:42,640 --> 00:13:44,170
You can take them all

193
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:46,010
but just spare my life

194
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:48,210
and let me return to the Burning Fire country.

195
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:52,970
You’re the most spineless person I have ever met

196
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:55,250
but also the smartest.

197
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:57,210
Alright,

198
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,970
I’ll let you go this time.

199
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:00,170
Now scram.

200
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,330
You...

201
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:19,130
I never said I'd let you go.

202
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:28,130
How kind of you.

203
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:30,810
Next time, I'll kill him myself.

204
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:32,890
You won't have to trouble yourself, Senior Brother.

205
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:55,610
I want your body,

206
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,410
dead man.

207
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:00,850
I’ll give you everything.

208
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,210
I just want

209
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:05,730
you to kill them for me.

210
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:07,490
Deal.

211
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:34,690
Wang Lin
Late stage Foundation Establishment

212
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:46,170
Teng Huayuan...

213
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:47,930
I, Wang Lin,

214
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:49,410
am coming back.

215
00:16:52,800 --> 00:16:54,290
Divine Sense,

216
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,370
return !

217
00:17:12,510 --> 00:19:14,560
There are multiple instances of Foreign Battlefields. Rank 4 countries compete with eachother regularly and low level countries cleanup after them. That is why only Foundation Establishment cultivators can enter the cleanup but in the flashback we see the Nascent Soul Ancestors of Xuan Dao and Heng Yue, Lin Yi had sent them in his stead.

The adaptation really messed up here because the amount of time skips is inconsistent. 50 years have passed which should've been 5000 years in the void of the spatial rift.

218
00:17:17,980 --> 00:17:23,870
I've been walking this path for endless years

219
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:23,870
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

220
00:17:24,260 --> 00:17:29,470
Is it the compass of fate

221
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:29,470
that wrote this outcome for us ?

222
00:17:29,380 --> 00:17:35,390
The heavens want to erase your existence,

223
00:17:35,260 --> 00:17:41,110
that's the obsession guiding me.

224
00:17:41,140 --> 00:17:46,710
Is this the path to uncover

225
00:17:43,020 --> 00:17:46,710
truths from falsehoods ?

226
00:17:46,740 --> 00:17:52,310
In a world of murk and shadow,

227
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:52,310
only the flame of truth can light the way.

228
00:17:52,100 --> 00:17:58,030
Look at them all,

229
00:17:54,980 --> 00:17:58,030
being carried by the waves.

230
00:17:58,220 --> 00:18:02,670
Look at them all,

231
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:02,670
being drowned.

232
00:18:02,500 --> 00:18:05,990
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

233
00:18:05,780 --> 00:18:09,070
I will let the world refine my soul.

234
00:18:08,950 --> 00:18:14,630
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

235
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:14,630
I will fight.

236
00:18:14,380 --> 00:18:17,750
I'll break through the abyss of despair

237
00:18:17,500 --> 00:18:20,790
to finally learn who I really am.

238
00:18:20,540 --> 00:18:26,150
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

239
00:18:22,420 --> 00:18:26,150
I embrace this obsession.

240
00:18:25,900 --> 00:18:29,110
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

241
00:18:28,860 --> 00:18:31,910
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

242
00:18:31,660 --> 00:18:37,390
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

243
00:18:33,700 --> 00:18:37,390
I'll still fight.

244
00:18:37,340 --> 00:18:40,750
It's hard to avoid loneliness

245
00:18:40,500 --> 00:18:43,790
when you are above everyone else.

246
00:18:43,540 --> 00:18:49,470
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

247
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:49,470
be afraid of a firefly ?
